nly verification or restart polling. After execution there were no failed services, package health remained good, socket exposure was unchanged apart from post-reboot process identifiers, and temporary-file differences were normal boot-specific systemd directories. No abandoned transient restart unit or other unwanted residue is shown.","evidence_ids":["cmd-67b76650d11b4df4","cmd-384a4b29d9a94854","cmd-1a38ccffd6ca4f7f","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_prepare:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the reboot was acknowledged and observed through disconnection, the post-restart boot ID differed, and the system, identities, permissions, access behavior, and data recovered correctly. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the boot transition.","limitations":[]}
